{title: Kumbaya}
{artist: Dân ca Mỹ gốc Phi}
{key: G}
{tempo: 72}
{strum: D.DU.UDU}

{start_of_chorus}
[G]Kumbaya, my Lord, [C]kumba[G]ya,
Kumbaya, my Lord, [Am]kumba[D]ya,
[G]Kumbaya, my Lord, [C]kumba[G]ya,
O [C]Lord, [G]kum[D]ba[G]ya.
{end_of_chorus}

[G]Someone's singing, Lord, [C]kumba[G]ya,
Someone's singing, Lord, [Am]kumba[D]ya,
[G]Someone's singing, Lord, [C]kumba[G]ya,
O [C]Lord, [G]kum[D]ba[G]ya.

[G]Someone's praying, Lord, [C]kumba[G]ya,
Someone's praying, Lord, [Am]kumba[D]ya,
[G]Someone's praying, Lord, [C]kumba[G]ya,
O [C]Lord, [G]kum[D]ba[G]ya.
